# Machine-readable citation metadata. GitHub renders this as the "Cite this
# repository" button; `cffconvert` turns it into BibTeX/APA.
# Authorship follows LICENSE and NOTICE.md (the organisation).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this harness or its benchmark data, please cite it.
title: "Health Agent Environment"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end pipeline for evaluating health agents: author cases with hidden
  control variables, run many models against them, and produce a report. The
  judging core is separable and versioned, so a score can be traced back to the
  exact criteria that produced it.
type: software
